  "metadata": {
    "name": "hook_timelock",
    "version": "0.1.0",
    "spec": "0.1.0",
    "description": "Bordrless hook timelock: holds a hook's (or a strategy's) upgrade authority behind a public delay of at least 3 days. Proposals carry the new code's executable hash on chain; anyone executes them once the delay has passed; the author can cancel; the authority can only ever move to none (immutable)."
  },
